  "notes": {
    "decisions": {
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Decisions where the brief was silent\n\n· Header Join is secondary off the landing page (one primary per page).\n· Referral link: a wrapping read-only text box, so the full code shows on phones.\n· Share link drawn below 1024 only.\n· /guarantee has the one midnight document band.\n· Tables of 3+ columns restack per row on phone (CSS only).\n· Sample {dyn}: wave 2, rank 14, 4 referrals, Tier 1, next tier at 6.\n· Full list on the Specs row and in the hand-off message.",
      "w": 980,
      "x": -1100,
      "y": 1500
    },
    "readme": {
      "fill": "gray",
      "size": 24,
      "text": "Valstara website · final UI design\n\nEvery board has two tweaks: theme (light by default) and annotations (off by default). Blue #1F5EDB is the annotation layer only, never part of the design. Boards 5, 8, 13, 17a and 18a are the annotated set: grid and column spans, spacing, elevation, type tokens, {dyn} values, the fold line and the scan path (1–4 in 3 seconds, 5–10 in 20 seconds).\n\nAll pages are real HTML and CSS on one shared stylesheet (valstara.css) with the section 4 tokens under their exact names. Layout responds by container queries, so every frame renders its true breakpoint.\n\nRows follow section 11.1. Boards 3, 10 and 11 are separate dark frames; every other board switches with the theme tweak.\n\nCopy is verbatim from the repo's copy layer and content files. The wireframe canvas is untouched.",
      "w": 980,
      "x": -1100,
      "y": 0
    },
